:''This article is about the Cat Unit. For the enemy, see [[SV-001 (Enemy)]].''
'''SV-001''' is a [[:Category:Super Rare Cats|Super Rare Cat]] that was implemented in [[Version 4.3 Update|Version 4.3]] and can be unlocked by playing the [[Cat Capsule#Rare Capsule|Rare Capsule]] during the [[Metal Slug Collaboration Event]].

{{Cat Info
|ID = 219
|rarity = SR
|name1 = SV-001
|name2 = SV-001 CC
}}

==Evolution==
Evolves into '''SV-001 CC''' at level 10.

==Strategy/Usage==
This unit can work fairly well early on due to its' relatively high health and damage, but afterwards it gets outclassed by [[Salon Cat (Rare Cat)|Cyborg Cat]] in terms of damage, cost and recharge, and [[Figure Skating Cats (Super Rare Cat)|Drama Cats]] in pretty much every area.

{{Job|Classification = Midranger}}

