==Trivia==
*[[wikia:metalslug:SV-001|SV-001]] is the "Metal Slug" that gives the series its name. SV-001 also stands for Super Vehicle-001.
*SV-001's Normal and Evolved Form descriptions originally began with "Recruited from Metal Slug Defense!". They were changed in [[Version 13.1 Update|Ver. 13.1]] of [[Nyanko Daisensou|BCJP]] and [[Version 13.7 Update|Ver. 13.7]] for all other versions to reflect the fact that ''Metal Slug Defense'' was no longer the specific game in the series that was being collaborated with.

